424
00:15:50,904 --> 00:15:52,472
a recall, a follow-up,

425
00:15:52,472 --> 00:15:54,966
another recall, and a class action.

426
00:15:55,146 --> 00:15:57,131
That is a lot of attention on

427
00:15:57,131 --> 00:15:57,747
