432
00:16:09,005 --> 00:16:11,203
The problem here is the cam phasers,

433
00:16:11,203 --> 00:16:13,340
the parts that adjust the timing of

434
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:14,195
the camshafts.

435
00:16:14,375 --> 00:16:15,879
According to SlashGear,

436
00:16:15,879 --> 00:16:18,430
owners point to the twenty seventeen to

437
00:16:18,430 --> 00:16:20,915
twenty twenty trucks as the main years

438
00:16:20,915 --> 00:16:22,484
for cam phaser failures,

439
00:16:22,484 --> 00:16:25,100
with some having them replaced more than

440
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:25,427
