473
00:17:39,610 --> 00:17:40,909
So with this engine,

474
00:17:40,909 --> 00:17:42,923
the year matters as much as the

475
00:17:42,923 --> 00:17:43,313
model.

476
00:17:43,493 --> 00:17:45,775
If you buy a twenty seventeen to

477
00:17:45,775 --> 00:17:48,485
twenty twenty, listen to a cold start,

478
00:17:48,485 --> 00:17:51,408
and ask whether the phasers were replaced

479
00:17:51,408 --> 00:17:53,048
