495
00:18:23,290 --> 00:18:25,098
And now the bonus engine,

496
00:18:25,098 --> 00:18:27,629
the three liter EcoDiesel V6 in the

497
00:18:27,629 --> 00:18:30,955
twenty fourteen to twenty nineteen Ram fifteen

498
00:18:30,955 --> 00:18:31,534
hundred.

499
00:18:31,714 --> 00:18:33,581
In October twenty nineteen,

500
00:18:33,581 --> 00:18:36,348
a recall covered about one hundred eight

501
00:18:36,348 --> 00:18:39,046
thousand of these trucks because of the

