A Tundra with a factory replacement engine.

566
00:20:50,764 --> 00:20:54,386
A Silverado with documented oil changes.

567
00:20:54,566 --> 00:20:57,399
A Super Duty with fuel filter records.

568
00:20:57,579 --> 00:21:00,911
An EcoDiesel with a dated cooler replacement.

569
00:21:01,091 --> 00:21:03,491
The same engine can be the riskiest

570
