580
00:21:25,051 --> 00:21:27,184
Three, listen to a cold start,

581
00:21:27,184 --> 00:21:30,171
ideally when the engine has sat overnight.

582
00:21:30,351 --> 00:21:33,807
Four, pay for an independent inspection before

583
00:21:33,807 --> 00:21:34,484
